# the epistemologic altitude. Sibling to @epistemologic/reality,
# @epistemologic/pact, @epistemologic/property, @epistemologic/
# cybernetic. Carries the THEORY of refinement types in mirror
# (predicate carriers, composition axioms, decidability boundary,
# Rice-safe connection); NOT operations (those live under
# @epistemologic/liquid/extraction as subspecies of theory).
#
# Landed per Alex 2026-07-17 arbitration of Taut Q-A/Q-B/Q-C from
