#   - Q-B: Novel discipline confirmed. Kagi surfaced no canonical
#          SOTA for recovering liquid/ownership types from LLVM/
#          machine code. Reed spec §8 novelty enumeration stands.
#   - Q-C: Three-altitude landing. @epistemologic/liquid is the
#          THEORY carrier one altitude UP from
#          @epistemologic/liquid/extraction (which operationally
#          instantiates the theory at the doc-code seam).
